Day 52 – System Design & Technical Architecture
 Objective

The objective of today's task was to design the complete technical architecture for the SmartHire AI project before beginning implementation. This included finalizing the system architecture, database schema, REST API design, UI wireframes, project folder structure, and verifying that the implementation plan remains achievable within the capstone timeline.

What I Did

Today, I reviewed the finalized Product Requirements Document (PRD), Implementation Blueprint, and Project Pitch Deck created during Day 51. Based on these documents, I designed the complete system architecture for SmartHire AI.

I finalized the frontend, backend, database, AI integration, and cloud deployment architecture. I also designed the database schema, REST API endpoints, user flow, low-fidelity wireframes, and project folder structure. Finally, I reviewed the remaining implementation plan to ensure that the project scope is realistic and ready for development starting from Day 53.

